      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together onion, garlic, rosemary, thyme, parsley, and basil in an 8-inch square baking pan; spread evenly in the bottom of the pan. Place tomatoes, cut-sides down, on top of the onion mixture. Drizzle olive oil on top. Sprinkle with sugar and season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven until tomatoes have started to collapse and are browning around the edges, about 2 1/2 hours.",
